msgid "Portal data plane"
msgstr "Portal 数据面"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:8
msgid ""
"Cross-cutting design aspect for how Portal UI and Habitat stay consistent "
"about **data**: requests, in-memory views, durable snapshots, conditional "
"HTTP cache, offline writes, sync, refresh, and live updates."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:10
msgid ""
"This is **not** a product feature module (unlike Chat or Diary). Sibling "
"docs under [`docs/aspects/`](./) hold the detailed mechanisms. Feature "
"modules link here when they touch the shared data path."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:12
msgid ""
"Related terms: **Portal data plane** (EN) / **Portal 数据面** (zh); also "
"“data-flow aspect”."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:14
msgid ""
"Attention (Inbox vs reminder vs local interrupt, Habitat sleep-until-next, "
"shell Attention hub) → [Notification and reminder](notification-and-"
"reminder.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why this aspect exists"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:18
msgid ""
"Today the pieces below often evolve feature-by-feature. Without one "
"vocabulary and one set of defaults, DX and UX suffer: full-list reloads "
"after small writes, mixed cache meanings, hand-rolled loading state, and "
"confusion between “offline” and “outbox pending”."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map of the plane"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  write[Write]\n"
"  mem[In_memory_view]\n"
"  idb[IDB_snapshot]\n"
"  outbox[Outbox]\n"
"  rpc[Habitat_RPC]\n"
"  etag[ETag_304]\n"
"  sync[Sync_flush]\n"
"  refresh[Refresh]\n"
"  live[Live_channel]\n"
"\n"
"  write --> mem\n"
"  write --> idb\n"
"  write --> outbox\n"
"  write --> rpc\n"
"  outbox --> sync\n"
"  sync --> refresh\n"
"  rpc --> etag\n"
"  etag --> mem\n"
"  rpc --> idb\n"
"  live --> mem\n"
"  refresh --> rpc\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Concern                      | Role                                                          | Primary doc / code                                      |\n"
"| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Habitat fetch gate           | No RPC when offline or Habitat not `connected`                | `isHabitatFetchAvailable`                               |\n"
"| In-memory view               | What the React tree shows                                     | Feature state / zustand; future shared hooks            |\n"
"| IDB snapshot                 | Durable read cache; offline read; failure fallback            | [Offline platform](offline-platform.md)                 |\n"
"| ETag / 304                   | Transport-layer conditional GET; not the business snapshot    | Habitat REST (`If-None-Match`)                          |\n"
"| Online write / outbox        | Prefer Habitat; enqueue on transport failure                  | [Offline platform](offline-platform.md)                 |\n"
"| sync                         | Reconnect / visibility: flush outbox then module `refreshAll` | [Page refresh](page-refresh.md), `OfflineSyncBootstrap` |\n"
"| refresh                      | User re-fetches current view                                  | [Page refresh](page-refresh.md)                         |\n"
"| live channels                | Limited auto (chat stream, conversation / pomodoro events)    | [Page refresh](page-refresh.md)                         |\n"
"| temp id / `client_op_id`     | Offline create identity and idempotent retry                  | [Offline platform](offline-platform.md)                 |\n"
"| connectivity UI vs outbox UI | Link down ≠ pending writes                                    | `connectivity-notice` vs sync toast                     |\n"
"| cache scope                  | Isolate by Habitat URL + subject                              | `resolveHabitatCacheScope`                              |\n"
"| PWA Service Worker           | Shell static assets only; **not** business RPC                | [Remote access](../ops/remote-access.md)                |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:61
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Core Principles"
msgid "Unified principles"
msgstr "核心原则"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**One vocabulary**: snapshot, outbox, sync, refresh, live, gate. Do not "
"narrate the plane in React Query terms."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**Three cache layers stay distinct**: in-memory view ≠ IndexedDB business "
"snapshot ≠ HTTP ETag/304."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**Limited auto**: sync + existing live channels. No global list polling. "
"Multi-device pull uses manual refresh unless a stronger protocol exists."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**Invalidate with granularity**: prefer local reload or key-level invalidate "
"after writes. Do not treat “reload the whole module list” as the only tool "
"(except agreed sync → `refreshAll`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**One optimistic write source**: offline-store / outbox. Do not add a second "
"optimistic mutation cache beside it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**DX may grow on this plane**: shared hooks are welcome; defaults follow "
"these principles. Do **not** adopt the React Query **library**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:70
msgid ""
"**Features must not fork the path**: reads use `withOfflineCache` (or "
"identical semantics); writes follow the outbox / `preferOnlineWrite` "
"contracts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:73
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Done"
msgid "Do"
msgstr "完成"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid ""
"Route list/get reads through `withOfflineCache` (or the same online-Habitat-"
"first / offline-snapshot semantics)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid ""
"On writable modules: online writes via `preferOnlineWrite`; offline or "
"transport failure via outbox; honor temp-id and `client_op_id` contracts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid ""
"Bind header Refresh and pull-to-refresh to the **same** page `reload` "
"handler."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid ""
"After a local write, reload or patch the **affected** view; reserve full-"
"module `refreshAll` for sync (and explicit product needs)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid "Keep connectivity chrome separate from outbox pending / failed toasts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:81
msgid ""
"When adding a module, register offline adapters and caps per [Offline "
"platform](offline-platform.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid "Hand-roll a second IndexedDB or memory cache that bypasses portal-sdk."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid "Conflate browser/PWA “reload” (shell assets) with business **refresh**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid ""
"Treat 304/ETag success as “IDB is fresh” without an explicit protocol that "
"ties them together."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid ""
"Default to focus-refetch or background list polling (React Query-style "
"automation)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid ""
"Use React Query Persist (or similar) against the same business namespaces as "
"`freeanima-portal-cache`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/portal-data-plane.md:90
msgid ""
"Show “reconnect and retry all” while Habitat is `connected` and the queue is "
"merely working."
msgstr ""

